@host = http://localhost:5227
@accessToken =
@projectId =
@memberUserId =

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login with dev domain credentials

### Copy accessToken from the response body to the @accessToken variable above.
# The response must also set refreshToken as an HttpOnly cookie.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.local",
  "password": "password"
}

### Get current user from JWT
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh access token from HttpOnly cookie
# This request has no body. The refreshToken must be sent by the HTTP client from cookie storage.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json

### Logout and remove refresh cookie
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Accept: application/json

### Negative check: login validation error
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": ""
}

### Negative check: protected endpoint without access token
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Accept: application/json

### Add project member
### Requires @accessToken of a user who is Admin in @projectId.
### Use @memberUserId from GET /api/v1/users after BE-3 is implemented.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{memberUserId}}",
  "role": "Member"
}

### Negative check: add the same project member again returns 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{memberUserId}}",
  "role": "Member"
}

### Change project member role
# Allowed roles: Member, Admin.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{memberUserId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Remove project member
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{memberUserId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Negative check: project member operation without Admin role returns 403 Forbidden
### Login as a non-admin project member, copy that token to @accessToken, then run this request.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{memberUserId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "role": "Member"
}
